All,

Attached are the CMF flyer for the CMF/Menno fusible service system and a o=
ne page brief that is the first brief on the subject.  It is meant to help =
you understand this product and its vulnerabilities.  This is not intended =
for you to use as a tool with customers.

This CMF product is a serious threat to Harco in Golf Irrigation.  Besides =
competing for a large dollar value sale on a golf project, CMF tries to tie=
 the sale of all the other fittings and valves  on the project to access to=
 this product.

More information will be coming as well as tools and tactics that can be us=
ed in the market.

J

